<title>USA: Emcor Group Q4 shr $0.20 vs $0.13.</title>
<headline>Emcor Group Q4 shr $0.20 vs $0.13.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.20   profit	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,952   profit	 1,231</p>
<p> Revs		     466,421		  417,226</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.95     loss	 $1.13</p>
<p> Net profit		 9,437     loss	10,853</p>
<p> Revs		   1,669,274		1,588,744</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The 1996 income figure reflects a $4.3 million charge resulting from a damage award against a subsidiary of the company in connection with a contract dispute.</p>
<p>Operating income for the year ended December 31, 1996 was $17.1 million, inclusive of the charges resulting from the adverse arbitration award.</p>
